  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, VRChat displays the platform labels for Avatars or Worlds on PC as \"Windows\" or \"Windows Compatible\".\n\nHowever, VRChat officially supports other PC operating systems, such as SteamOS.\n\n(Steam shows \"Deck Verified\" on the store page, and lists SteamOS is listed as a supported platform in VRChat's official press.)\n\nIn the past, VRChat may have only supported the Windows PC platform.\n\nNow, however, it supports any other PC platforms and is compatible with the Windows version.\n\nThis may lead to other PC platform users to mistakenly believe that the \"Windows\" label is only works on Windows.\n\nTherefore, I think the \"Windows\" label should be changed to \"PC\".",
